            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="0896" n="860" xml:id="pg860"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1958-60v07p1"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1958–1960, Volume VII, Part
                        1</ref>, Western European Integration and Security, Canada. Please be aware
                    that printed volumes have not been
                    revised.<!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d95">Document 95</ref>, Page 227
                            (date of correction: June 4, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The description of Foreign Minister Joseph Luns has
                        been corrected from “Belgian” to “Dutch.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
